# wip385 (MIDI step S2): the REMOTE PANEL. Notes on the remote channel are panel keys: note 53 + k = key k (F3 = 53).
# Remote OFF (default): nothing. Channel 11 (status 9A / 8A): note on = key down, note off = key up; no voice plays.
# A chord arriving in the "wrong" order (black key first, FILL second) still works: modifiers are applied first.
wait 300
midi 9A 35 64
wait 100
expect ukeys 0
remch 11
midi 9A 35 64
wait 100
expect ukeys 1
midi 8A 35 00
wait 100
expect ukeys 0
midi 9A 35 64
wait 100
midi 9A 35 00
wait 100
expect ukeys 0
midi 99 35 64
wait 100
expect ukeys 0
expect noteons 0
midi 9A 35 64
midi 9A 37 64
wait 100
expect ukeys 5
midi BA 7B 00
wait 100
expect ukeys 0
# MIDI chord on the MUTE / SOLO page: FILL (note 75) + black key 3 (note 58), black key sent FIRST: still a solo
tap FX
tap FX
spin ALGO 1
expect solo 0
midi 9A 3A 64
midi 9A 4B 64
wait 100
midi 8A 3A 00
midi 8A 4B 00
wait 100
expect ukeys 0
expect solo 3
